Discover peer mentorship supports from across York, all in one place! Connect with peer mentors from Keele Campus in the Vari Hall Rotunda, Glendon Campus in the Breezeway & Markham Campus in the 1st Floor West Atrium to ask questions and explore mentorship opportunities. Chat with students who have been in your position and gain valuable insights, tips and advice that go beyond websites and textbooks.
Visit the Keele Campus in the Vari Hall Rotunda, Glendon Campus in the Breezeway & Markham Campus in the 1st Floor West Atrium  during Peer Mentorship Day to:

meet peer mentors from across York;
explore supports;
sign up for a mentorship program (or learn how to become a mentor!);
make a friendship bracelet;
and more.

Wednesday, Jan. 13
10 a.m. to 2 p.m. 
No registration required.
